  "$description": "Catppuccin's open palette (@catppuccin/palette 1.8.0, MIT): Latte in light and Mocha in dark, with Mauve as the hue. Base is the raised surface in both modes; Latte has nothing lighter, so base is also its page. Muted text is Subtext 1 in Latte, where Subtext 0 misses 4.5:1.",
